OL,3,GNEWSAHow a giant cockerel sculpture
OL,4,Abecame a celebrity
OL,5,
OL,6,F"In the 19th Century, they were really
OL,7,Fpopular for eating and for eggs. They
OL,8,Fwere bred here by local farmers and
OL,9,Ffarmers' wives and brought up to market
OL,10,Fin Dorking, and then they were all
OL,11,Ftaken up to the London market."
